    <briefdescription>
<para>Immutable fencing token carried with every write RPC. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A peer rejects any request whose epoch is strictly less than its own current epoch. The token is cheaply copyable and trivially serialisable. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
